WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.003
- So wait Tim, where are you calling from?

00:00:02.003 --> 00:00:03.540
- I'm in, I'm in New York,

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.060
we're doing some press up here

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.880
and I'm actually getting to see

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.720
a couple of our daughters who live here.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.380
So we're getting to hang out
with them for a little bit.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.300
- Oh, that's exciting.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.520
Are they in school up there

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.650
or are they just living up
there? What are they doing?

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.620
- Both of them are actors.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.290
So they're there in New York
pursuing that, that job.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.450
- Okay. Last time I saw you,

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.230
you were here and one of
them was still in school

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.440
and I was like, all right.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.619
And you were like,

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:26.573
I don't know if she's
going to leave school.

00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:31.257
- All grown up now,
they're out on their own.

00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:33.837
So we're empty-nesters but it's, it's,

00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:36.870
it's a blessing and a curse
at the same time, I guess.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.812
So, you know, you miss them
and you miss the energy

00:00:38.812 --> 00:00:40.680
and you miss them being
around, around the house,

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.513
and all their friends,

00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:42.930
and all the stuff that
comes along with that.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.070
But it's also nice for mom and dad

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:47.240
to have the house to themselves
every now and then to.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.360
- Hell yeah. Bring that fire back.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.359
What!

00:00:50.359 --> 00:00:55.350
Well, well, Tim in 1883,
Faith plays your wife,

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.600
so that must've been a stretch

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.150
and Isabel plays your daughter.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.320
Does she fit in, right,

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.170
right in with your family?

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.280
I feel like literally
I'm looking at a girl

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.830
that could have come from y'all, so.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.030
- When we first saw Izzy,

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.020
when we walked, the
first day at cowboy camp,

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.520
we walked in.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.699
I mean, of course she's,

00:01:11.699 --> 00:01:12.790
she's just beautiful and sweet,

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:14.870
and so poised and so mature.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:18.326
But when we first saw
her, we went right away,

00:01:18.326 --> 00:01:19.992
right away, we thought, my gosh, she, she,

00:01:19.992 --> 00:01:21.350
she looks like she could be our daughter.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.820
I mean, it was this perfect casting.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:24.260
And, and,

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.510
and then the more we got to know her,

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:29.180
the sweeter she got and the
more we grew to love her

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:30.510
and respected her.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.430
And, and she, she's just a, she's a,

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:34.910
she's incredible,

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.240
she just shines in the show and,

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.550
and anybody who knows her

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.700
and it was around her on set,

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.860
knows that she shines in person as well,

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:42.990
and in real life.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.680
- I miss you Tim.

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.137
- That's so sweet.

